// Tests of the PDF generation layer (lib/pdf/cycle_pdf.dart): the pure
// header-facts function (with the anonymize mapping), the rail-caption
// legends (the pure strings the private scaffold rows use) and the
// byte-stream smoke checks of the generated document.
//
// Structural page-count checks rely on the layout planner (the one-cycle-
// per-page rule); the generated byte stream itself is only smoke-checked
// (non-empty, PDF signature, the uncompressed page markers) — the PDF
// structure is deliberately not parsed beyond countable markers — except
// where a rendering fact (e.g. the weekend band shade) is pinned verbatim
// in the uncompressed content stream.
